{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04","cat":"bond","group":{"id":"char5151","label":"Ade: Agent Bunny"},"label":"A Special Agent's Qualities","stage":null,"prev":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_03","next":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_05","speakers":{"ade_b":"Ade"},"icons":{"ade_b":"si_c315_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_1","text":"... S-so, if I comprehend alright...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"MaidCafe","bgArt":"maidcafe","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_overjoy","movie":null,"shown":["ade_b"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_2","text":"I am a special agent, disguised as a maid, sent to gain the acquaintance of a gentleman who frequents the Maid Cafe.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_3","text":"At present, I am executing a mission to procure from him that which is required.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_4","text":"Is that correct...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_5","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_5","text":"Yep.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_6","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_6","text":"And that mission is to retrieve the object in my inner pocket.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_7","text":"Your inner pocket...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_8","text":"Indeed, such a task requires that I assume the mindset of a special agent,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_9","text":"rather than that of a maid.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_10","text":"Yet I must not neglect my duties as a maid, for I am, after all, undercover.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_11","text":"Very well. Let us commence.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_12","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_12","text":"With this exercise, Ade's training begins in earnest.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_13","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_13","text":"The goal? To separate her maid side and her special agent side once and for all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_14","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_14","text":"Take 1.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_15","text":"Welcome, M-Master.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_16","text":"Wh-what would you like—","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_17","text":"Cut.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_18","text":"Oh dear... this proves far more embarrassing than I had imagined...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_19","text":"That's because you're still not in the right mindset.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_20","text":"Yes... indeed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_21","text":"A special agent ought not be embarrassed by her attire.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_22","text":"That, I fear, is evidence that I have yet to free myself from my maidly inclinations.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_23","text":"... I shall endeavor once more.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_24","text":"This time, I shall succeed...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_25","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_25","text":"Take 2.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_26","text":"Welcome, Master.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_27","text":"What would you l-like...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_28","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_29","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_29","text":"... Looks like we'll be here a while.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_30","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_30","text":"Take 9.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_32","text":"Welcome, Master.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_33","text":"What would you like to order?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_34","text":"A Fluttering Mint Tea of Joy, please.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_35","text":"Very well, I shall prepare it for you at once.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_36","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_36","text":"*Pour*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_37","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_37","text":"Ade elegantly pours the tea, lifting the pot higher and higher to create a visually stunning performance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_38","text":"No matter how many times I see you do this, I'll never get tired of it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_39","text":"Hehe, thank you for your kind words.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_40","text":"... Oh my, Master!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_41","text":"It appears there is something upon your coat. If you would be so kind, might I take it off...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_42","text":"and clean it for you...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_43","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_43","text":"... Nice try, but it's far too obvious.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_44","text":"W-was that so?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_45","text":"*Sigh* It seems I still find this rather difficult.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_46","text":"Um... Master, might I ask in what way my efforts fell short?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_47","text":"I am still unaccustomed to this aspect of myself, and thus cannot quite tell...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_48","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_48","text":"You were too polite. It felt like the maid part of you was coming through again.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_49","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_49","text":"That's where you failed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_50","text":"Is that so...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_51","text":"It seems my excessive politeness rendered the situation somewhat awkward.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_52","text":"Hmm... In that case, how ought I to have approached the matter just now...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_53","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_53","text":"With something like this, you shouldn't ask so politely. Be more assertive.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_54","text":"Assertive...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_55","text":"Yes, Master, your words are well received.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_56","text":"... I am, at present, a special agent in the guise of a maid.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_57","text":"'Tis my duty to fulfil my mission as a special agent above all maidly proprieties...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_58","text":"For that end, I must be prepared, if need be, to employ somewhat bolder measures.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ade_agentbunny_04_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_Nik